OL,3,GNEWSAPrison fire systems not upgraded  
OL,4,Adespite mum's death                    
OL,6,FA woman whose mother died in a prison  
OL,7,Fcell fire says her family "can't get   
OL,8,Fclosure" because the safety concerns   
OL,9,Flinked to her death remain unresolved  
OL,10,Ffour years later.                      
OL,12,FAn inquest into the death of Clare     
OL,13,FDupree at HMP Eastwood Park found      
OL,14,Fdelays in detecting the fire           
OL,15,Fcontributed to her death. Despite      
OL,16,Fenforcement notices from fire safety   
OL,17,Finspectors, there is still no automatic
OL,18,Ffire detection (AFD) in cells at the   
OL,19,Fprison, the BBC has found.             
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
