OL,3,GNEWSAPrison fire systems not upgraded  
OL,4,Adespite mum's death                    
OL,6,F"I don't think that's good enough -    
OL,7,Fshe's been dead four years," said her  
OL,8,Fdaughter Cerys.                        
OL,10,FA prison service spokesperson said it  
OL,11,Ftook fire safety "extremely seriously" 
OL,12,Fand it was continuing to make upgrades,
OL,13,Fincluding automatic fire detection in  
OL,14,Fevery cell.                            
